    "finalName": "",
    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, you may tweak the settings, grips, and moving parts of a powered weapon you wield, tailoring it to your needs. For the remainder of a the encounter, you gain a +1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus on attack rolls, and a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus on damage rolls with that weapon.<br><br>You can use this Talent only on powered weapons (those that require an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cell</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> to operate), including weapons connected to a larger power source (such as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Systems\" title=\"Weapon Systems\">Weapon Systems</a>).",
